            <div xml:id="d240">

                <pb facs="0420" n="324" xml:id="pg324"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/8770: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-07-15T22:00:00+09:00">July 15, 1937—10
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received July 15—10:15 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>202. My 201, July 15, 9 p.m. It has just been announced that the Cabinet has
                    decided to despatch to North China reenforcements of undisclosed number of
                    troops.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Peiping.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
